tderr.Bytes()))\n+\t}\n+\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"scope selection over %s: %v\", label, diffErr)\n+}\n+\n+// scopeRevisions are the revisions a scope diff names: base and head, the\n+// ends of a range written A..B or A...B, and X for X^-.\n+func scopeRevisions(base, head string) []string {\n+\tvar revs []string\n+\tfor _, r := range []string{base, head} {\n+\t\tif r == \"\" {\n+\t\t\tcontinue\n+\t\t}\n+\t\tif k := strings.Index(r, \"^-\"); k > 0 {\n+\t\t\tr = r[:k]\n+\t\t}\n+\t\tsep := \"..\"\n+\t\tif strings.Contains(r, \"...\") {\n+\t\t\tsep = \"...\"\n+\t\t}\n+\t\tfor _, part := range strings.Split(r, sep) {\n+\t\t\tif part == \"\" {\n+\t\t\t\tpart = \"HEAD\"\n+\t\t\t}\n+\t\t\trevs = append(revs, part)\n+\t\t}\n+\t}\n+\treturn revs\n+}\ndiff --git a/pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_handoff.go b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_handoff.go\nindex c5b6278b..c157a8cb 100644\n--- a/pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_handoff.go\n+++ b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_handoff.go\n@@ -344,7 +344,14 @@ func (s Store) PlanReviewHandoff(id, agent string) (DispatchPlan, error) {\n \t}\n \t// A handoff runs in the attempt's runtime directory too (spec\n \t// pose-review-resume-keeps-the-sealed-checkout, review round 2, N6).\n-\tif e = reviewRunRuntimeDirFree(prior.AttemptID, \"hand off\"); e != nil {\n+\tif e = reviewRunRuntimeDirFree(runtimeSourceOf(*prior), \"hand off\"); e != nil {\n+\t\t// Another resume takes the directory just before its claim: a claim\n+\t\t// that appears meanwhile makes this one pending (spec\n+\t\t// pose-review-resume-runtime-dir-followups R1).\n+\t\tif pending := s.awaitContinuationClaim(*prior); pending != nil {\n+\t\t\tplan.PendingContinuation = pending\n+\t\t\treturn plan, nil\n+\t\t}\n \t\treturn DispatchPlan{}, e\n \t}\n \tcount, spent, limit, total, e := attemptContinuationBudget(runs, *prior, policy)\ndiff --git a/pose-mcp/internal/pose/git_index_open_other.go b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/git_index_open_other.go\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000